WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:16,300
I'm going to be meeting two different breast surgeons in the coming weeks and want to be prepared with good questions.

00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:23,300
I want to avoid problems or complications later if I do have surgery.

00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:33,300
I don't know what to look out for or what to request so that I may be discerning and choose the right person or team any advice.

00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:40,300
That's really hard. You have to just feel comfortable with your surgeon, surgeon number one.

00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:48,300
So I always suggest that you do have a meeting or two with that with him or her and that you feel comfortable.

00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:55,300
You should be praying about that and get asked that God gives you discernment in this.

00:00:55,300 --> 00:01:02,300
There are any really specific questions that I can think of or things to look for in that.

00:01:02,300 --> 00:01:10,300
It's really whether they're hopeful and they feel like they're honest with you.

00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:16,300
You don't want to do surgery just because that's the thing that they do at this point.

00:01:16,300 --> 00:01:19,300
You want to do surgery because it's the right thing for you.

00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:27,300
And you want a surgeon that thinks that too so that they look at your case and look at your CT scanner MRI or anything and they say,

00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:29,300
yeah, I think this is what we're going to do.

00:01:29,300 --> 00:01:31,300
I think this is going to be really good.

00:01:31,300 --> 00:01:34,300
Ask, you know, there's nothing wrong with asking, what would you do if this was your sister?

00:01:34,300 --> 00:01:39,300
You know, what would you do if this is your wife or your your friend, your best friend?

00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:43,300
Could you please be just honest with me and ask of that question.

00:01:43,300 --> 00:01:48,300
Please really be honest with me and see if you get a heartfelt honest answer.

00:01:48,300 --> 00:01:51,300
So that's what I would do.

